meta { name: List public categories, type: http, seq: 1 }
get { url: {{publicBase}}/categories, body: none, auth: none }
headers { X-Tenant-Key: {{techTenantKey}} }
docs {
  Site navigation. Live categories only.

  Must NOT contain articleCount — that counts drafts, and exposing it would
  leak how many unpublished pieces a tenant is sitting on. The public DTO is a
  separate class, not the admin one with fields removed.

  NOTE: Kong proxy-caches this for 60s and each site caches it in Nitro for
  300s, so an edit takes up to ~6 minutes to reach a reader.
}
